### Opening a node from its directory, and what goes wrong doing it.

node-opening-record = opening this node's record
node-reading-record = reading this node's record
node-does-not-verify = this node's own record does not verify
node-opening-witnessed = opening what was witnessed
node-opening-statements = opening the statements
node-opening-addresses = opening the addresses
node-reading-addresses = reading the addresses
node-writing = writing { $path }
